Sweet Home 3D default furniture catalog
----------------------------------------
Catalog models selected by the spike are recorded individually in each generated
manifest. The MCP API does not expose a per-model license field. Sweet Home 3D's
official license page states that models distributed with the default catalog may
be redistributed with generated homes and renders. This provenance limitation is
preserved in the manifest instead of inventing model-specific license metadata.
